title: "Vanguard Trust Lab"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Vanguard Trust Lab Contributors"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-bounded study of Riot Vanguard's public host-level trust model,
  accompanied by a dependency-free browser demonstrator for privilege
  boundaries, platform-posture concepts, and local SHA-256 comparison.
